cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, the benchmark results, or the deposited tables,
  please cite both the article and this repository.
title: "ComboBatch: a benchmark of transcriptomic harmonization methods for follicular lymphoma and DLBCL"
abstract: >-
  Code, metric tables and figures accompanying a systematic benchmark of
  transcriptomic batch-effect harmonization across 7,174 samples from 88
  follicular lymphoma, DLBCL and normal B-cell cohorts spanning 19 platforms.
  39 harmonization methods were implemented and 31 evaluated across 14
  sample-removal strategies, 3 imputation modes and 2 post-removal variants,
  scored on 87 metrics in 14 groups, yielding a biomaterial- and
  platform-conditional decision tree for choosing a harmonization method.
type: software
